OL,3,GNEWSAWonky bridge to remain closed for
OL,4,Amonths
OL,5,
OL,6,FA city centre footbridge which was left
OL,7,Fpartially hanging after a dramatic
OL,8,Fmalfunction is due to be back in
OL,9,Fservice by next spring.
OL,11,FPero's Bridge, which spans Bristol's
OL,12,Ffloating harbour, was shut a month ago
OL,13,Fafter it broke down during a test lift,
OL,14,Fleaving the middle section standing at
OL,15,Fa wonky angle.
OL,17,FA #1.35m maintenance scheme to remove
OL,18,Fthe bridge spans and repair them was
OL,19,Fdue to be carried out in November but
OL,20,Fis now expected to happen sooner.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
