OL,3,GNEWSAWonky bridge to remain closed for
OL,4,Amonths
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Andrew Brown, chair of the
OL,7,FHarbour Committee, said: "We appreciate
OL,8,Feveryone's patience [but] when we
OL,9,Freturn the bridge to service it will be
OL,10,Ffully refurbished with significant
OL,11,Fupgrades - improving the bridges'
OL,12,Freliability and functionality."
